        {
          "text": "UMose wabiza yonke inhlangano yabantwana bakwa-Israyeli, wathi kubo: “Nanka amazwi uJehova ayala ngawo ukuba niwenze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.1",
