        {
          "text": "Bonke abantu abatholakala kubo izindwangu ezibubende, eziyibubende, ezibomvu, nelineni elicolekileyo, noboya bembuzi, nezikhumba zezimvu ezibomvu, nezikhumba zamatahasi, baziletha.",
