          "text": "Abantwana bakwa-Israyeli baletha umnikelo wesihle kuJehova, bonke abesilisa nabesifazane abanhliziyo yabo yabavumela ukuba balethe yonke imisebenzi eyayaleza uJehova ngesandla sikaMose ukuba yenziwe.",
